      "body": "## Motivation\n\nRelated to #39444. Keep write-through backup scheduling covered when a request adds its prefix in multiple chunks.\n\n## Modifications\n\nAdd a Rust tree-core integration test on the unified cache path. It inserts a prefix, extends it with a second chunk, and asserts that both inserts emit a `BackupKV` action.\n\n## Validation\n\nPython compilation, Ruff formatting and undefined-name checks, and whitespace checks pass on the VPS. The runtime test could not run locally because this checkout lacks `pytest` and `torch`; SGLang's `run-ci` label requires maintainer permission.\n",
